<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aware cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aware cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said Wednesday it cut its rating on Aware Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Dain also cut its estimate for 1987 to a loss of $0.08 a share from a loss of $0.06 and for 1998 to a loss of $0.07 from break-even.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Aware reported second quarter loss of $0.01 a share, down from break-even earnings a year ago, which were &quot;essentially in line with our expectations,&quot; Dain said.</p>
<p>-- Aware shares were off 1-13/16 to 11-13/16.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
